Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>2. Nazro'n par lashkar ko roka teen din ki pyaas me<br />
Darya se waapas hai aaya teen din ki pyaas me<br />
moujei'n sar ko takraati hain pyaasa hai darya<br />
Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>3. Khainch ke teero'n ko seene se shumr chadha tha seene par<br />
