Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>4. Beti Zehra(s.a) ki bechaadar aati'n hai bazaar me<br />
chadar lekar aao bhai jaana hai darbaar me<br />
uryaa'n sar darbaar me kaise jayegi dukhiya<br />
Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s) Abbas(a.s)</p>

<p>5. Zainab(s.a) ko dharas thi tumse aye Ghazi Abbas(a.s)<br />
